{"step_index":3457,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T17:33:57Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-22T20:33:57+03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-22T20:33:57+03:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/walkthrough.md`\nTotal Lines: 89\nTotal Bytes: 6032\nShowing lines 1 to 89\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # Walkthrough: Dynamic Summary Formulas, Review Real-time Sync, Global Progress Modal & Production Deployment\n2: \n3: All requested enhancements, bug fixes, and production packaging have been implemented and verified end-to-end.\n4: \n5: ---\n6: \n7: ## 1. Dynamic Excel Summary Formulas (`ملخص`)\n8: - **Implemented Dynamic Formulas**:\n9:   - `إجمالي الأصناف المطلوبة`: `=B3+B4+B5`\n10:   - `تم مطابقتها`: `=SUM(B8:B{7+N})` (sums warehouse matched counts)\n11:   - `لم يُعثر عليها`: `=MAX(0, COUNTA('لم يُعثر عليه'!A:A)-1)`\n12:   - `تحتاج مراجعة`: `=MAX(0, COUNTA('يحتاج مراجعة'!A:A)-1)`\n13:   - Warehouse details table (rows 8+):\n14:     - Col 2: `=MAX(0, COUNTA('{sheet}'!A:A)-1)`\n15:     - Col 3: `=COUNTIF('يحتاج مراجعة'!D:D, \"{warehouse_name}\")`\n16:   - Percentages formatted dynamically with `=IF(B2>0, B3/B2, 0)` and formatted as `0.0%`.\n17: - **Confidence Values in Arabic**:\n18:   - Replaced technical codes (`exact`, `high`, `llm`) with professional Arabic terms:\n19:     - `تطابق تام (100%)`\n20:     - `تطابق نصي دقيق (X%)`\n21:     - `مطابقة ذكية (AI)`\n22:     - `تأكيد يدوي (مراجعة)`\n23: \n24: ---\n25: \n26: ## 2. Review Workflow & UI Synchronization\n27: - **Fixed Toast Message (`undefined` bug)**:\n28:   - Fixed toast message in `applyReviews()`: now clearly shows:\n29:     `تم تنفيذ التعديلات! تم اعتماد: X مطابق، Y غير متوفر، والمتبقي للمراجعة: Z`.\n30: - **\n<truncated 2857 bytes>\nمطلوب: [اسم]، المتوفر: [اسم])\"`.\n62: - **Identical Counts / Manufacturer Suffix**:\n63:   - Equal counts (e.g. 3 ampoules == ٣ امبولات) and items where the only difference is the manufacturer suffix (`/نوفارتس`, `/اكاديميا`) are now recognized as **100% confirmed matches** instead of going to review.\n64: \n65: ---\n66: \n67: ## 6. Complete Environment Cleanup\n68: - Deleted all Unstructured API result files (`transform-result-*.json`).\n69: - Cleared the `processes` history table in `data/history.db`.\n70: - Cleaned out all previous process directories under `data/processes/`.\n71: - Re-packaged a fresh, clean distribution in `dist_production/`.\n72: \n73: ---\n74: \n75: ## 7. Verification Results\n76: \n77: | Component / Test | Result |\n78: | :--- | :--- |\n79: | **Excel Summary Formulas** | PASSED: Dynamic Excel formulas `=B3+B4+B5`, `=SUM(...)`, `=COUNTA(...)` generated and verified |\n80: | **Confidence Arabic Names** | PASSED: Shows `تطابق تام (100%)`, `تطابق نصي دقيق (97%)`, `مطابقة ذكية (AI)` |\n81: | **Review Sync & Toast** | PASSED: Returns `new_stats`, updates cards instantly, no `undefined` in toast |\n82: | **Review Count Alignment** | PASSED: Coordinator summary matches Excel row count (16 == 16) |\n83: | **Left-Side Modal Overlay** | PASSED: Bounded inside `.main-content`, leaves sidebar accessible |\n84: | **Process Queue Mechanics** | PASSED: Tested auto-start from queue (`['PROC-001', 'PROC-002']`) and queue removal |\n85: | **Brand vs Generic Routing** | PASSED: Roaccutane vs Isotretinoin, Zovirax vs Lovir routed to `يحتاج مراجعة` |\n86: | **Identical Count Matching** | PASSED: Voltaren 3 ampoules / Novartis matched directly |\n87: | **Environment Cleanup** | PASSED: History and temporary process files cleaned completely |\n88: | **Production Packaging** | PASSED: Standalone `dist_production/` folder created with `run_app.bat` and `README_SETUP.md` |\n89: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
{"step_index":3458,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T17:33:57Z","thinking":"Parallel execution using a thread pool is required to process warehouse files efficiently. The 22-page Hadaba PDF was parsed successfully, extracting all 1,071 items after addressing timeout issues. A fault-tolerant design incorporating per-file error handling with automatic Gemini 3.6 Flash fallback is essential to prevent pipeline failures.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Updated walkthrough with Parallel Processing, Hadaba fix, Gemini fallback, and End-to-End verification\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Walkthrough: Parallel Processing, Resilient Extraction, Gemini Fallback & Production Deployment\\n\\nAll requested enhancements, bug fixes, parallel performance optimizations, and production packaging have been implemented and verified end-to-end.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Parallel Multi-Threaded File Extraction (المعالجة المتوازية للملفات)\\n- **Problem**: Previously, files were uploaded and processed sequentially one-by-one. When processing multiple warehouse catalogs (e.g. 6 PDFs), the total time accumulated to over 30 minutes, and any single network timeout aborted all remaining files.\\n- **Solution (`src/extract/file_handler.py`)**:\\n  - Implemented `ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=min(len(filepaths), 8))`.\\n  - All warehouse files (PDF, Excel, JSON) are now dispatched concurrently in parallel threads.\\n  - The Unstructured API accepts concurrent requests, allowing all cloud extraction jobs to run simultaneously.\\n  - Finished files are returned, saved, and cached independently as soon as they complete.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. 22-Page Hadaba PDF Resolution (`الهضبة الاثنين نقدى0.pdf`)\\n- **Problem**: \\n  - The 22-page Hadaba PDF document timed out on synchronous HTTP requests (> 16 minutes), and when it completed, Unstructured returned 0 items because the data was formatted as an HTML `<table>` in `markdown` rather than `extracted_data`.\\n- **Solution (`src/extract/pdf_reader.py`)**:\\n  - Extended polling timeout to 24 minutes (180 attempts × 8s) with an initial 20-second fast-wait to prevent hanging synchronous sockets.\\n  - Enhanced `parse_structured_result()`:\\n    1. First inspects schema `extracted_data`.\\n    2. If empty or absent, parses HTML `<table><tr><td>...</td></tr></table>` directly from `result[\\\"markdown\\\"]` with automatic column detection (Arabic column headers like `اسم الصنف`, `اسم الدواء`).\\n  - **Result**: Successfully extracted **1,071 drug items** with full names, strengths, and pack sizes.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Resilience & Automatic Gemini 3.6 Flash \n<truncated 2523 bytes>","Description":"\"Update walkthrough with parallel extraction and verification results\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\kakak\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Update walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Document parallel processing and extraction verification\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
